l star the true hero of our story: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997920/extras/5e294ed1983cc03a3819a5f7eb8057e3.avif?t=1738954805\" width=616 height=415 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an odyssey into the unknown! Behold the tale of Toadman, an enigmatic being born from alien tech and the mysteries of Radiant Verde. Witness his perilous quest through treacherous jungles to confront Captain Croak in an epic showdown! Welcome to &quot;Spawn of the Spore Spectre&quot;!",
